  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.7.2.1, client-only changes against Firefly III API 6.7.2. Charts now deserialize: ChartDataSet.Entries/PcEntries and ChartDataSetV2.Entries/NativeEntries read the object the server sends (label to value, numbers or numeric strings, [] when empty) through ChartEntriesConverter, and ChartDataPoint/ChartDataPointV2 gained Value; before, every /v1/chart call threw. Nullable annotations: optional Refit parameters and optional model constructor parameters are nullable, and optional model properties accept null ([AllowNull]), so a nullable-enabled consumer can leave a field unset without CS8601/CS8604/CS8625. Getters keep their declared types. Required-but-nullable fields accept null instead of throwing ArgumentNullException, and send it: PiggyBankStore/PiggyBankProperties.TargetAmount (no target), RecurrenceStore.RepeatUntil (no end), RuleAction/RuleActionStore.Value, PiggyBankAccountStore.Id, TransactionSplit.SourceId/DestinationId.",
